label "Canary and shadow deployment diagram"
box traffic 16 104 80 44 "live|traffic"
box inc 170 30 120 44 "current version"
box can 170 104 120 44 "canary|small slice" acc
box sha 170 178 120 44 "shadow|copy only"
box users 350 60 90 44 "users"
box cmp 350 160 90 50 "compare|+ log"
arrow traffic inc
arrow traffic can
arrow traffic sha dashed
arrow inc users
arrow can users
arrow sha cmp
arrow can cmp dashed
note "dashed: copies and comparisons; shadow output is not served"
